This code will read the analog output of the two microphones, convert the raw data to sound pressure levels in dB, and log the values to `audio_log.txt` at a rate of 10 Hz. If either sensor read fails, it will log an error value of -999.0 dB and continue running. The program will exit cleanly when a SIGINT or SIGTERM signal is received, closing the I2C handles and terminating the pigpio library.

