This code initializes the pigpio library, opens I2C bus 1, sets up the I2C bus for the MLX75030's default address, and enters a loop where it reads the distance measurement from the sensor every 100 ms. It checks the return values of all pigpio initialization and I2C read/write calls, retries failed I2C transactions up to 3 times with a 10 ms delay between retries, and handles sensor-absent or bus-error paths gracefully. It also ensures clean resource release, closing the I2C handle and terminating pigpio, on all exit paths, including graceful shutdown on SIGINT (Ctrl+C).

