Note that this code assumes that the BMP180 sensor is connected to I2C bus 1 and has the address 0x77. You may need to modify the code to match your specific setup.

Also, this code uses the `MathPow` function from the `math.h` library to calculate the square root in the `calculateTemperature` and `calculatePressure` functions. If you don't have this function available, you can use a different method to calculate the square root.

