This code uses the pigpio library to detect rotation events from two Melexis MLX90217 unipolar Hall-effect sensors connected to GPIO 17 and GPIO 27. It uses a quadrature state machine to determine the direction of rotation and logs each detected rotation event to a file named 'rotation_log.txt' with a millisecond-precision timestamp. The code also sets up a signal handler for SIGINT and SIGTERM to ensure a clean shutdown and log the final rotation state.

