This code uses the `pigpio` library to control the GPIO pins and generate the precise WS2812B timing waveform. It reads the ambient light levels from the BH1750 I2C digital light sensor and maps the readings to a smooth, non-linear (logarithmic) brightness value for the LED strip. It also handles I2C errors and sensor-absent conditions with retries and cleanly releases all resources on SIGINT and SIGTERM.

