This code uses the pigpio library to detect motion with a Keyes KY-033 IR Obstacle Avoidance Sensor on GPIO 17 (physical pin 11). When motion is detected, it records a 5-second video using raspivid and logs the event to a file. The code also implements debouncing with a 200 ms minimum interval between triggers. The program runs continuously until interrupted with a SIGINT signal, at which point it closes the log file and terminates pigpio.

