This code initializes the Adafruit AS7341 sensor over I2C, performs a WHO_AM_I register check, configures the SMUX for spectral readings, enables spectral measurement, and reads the 10 spectral channels. It then computes a simplified lux approximation and logs the results to a CSV file every 5 seconds. The code also handles errors and releases resources on all exit paths, including SIGINT.

